## Methodology and limitations

Discord activity is the weekly mean of approximate members online. Streaming values are weekly means sampled daily at {{ sampling_hour }}:00 UTC. Twitch category totals reflect the top 1,000 live channels and undercount the long tail. Kick totals reflect up to {{ kick_limit }} active channels returned by the cursor-paginated public API. Press counts use canonical URLs and case-insensitive configured title aliases. Week over week means this report week compared with the preceding seven-day UTC period. Titles moving in the same direction across at least two sources receive an agreement flag. No composite score is calculated.

